{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Exempt smokeless tobacco (snuff) from the generational tobacco ban",
        "additional_details": "We believe that with government support we could have a society that has a more mature relationship with both tobacco and substance use, using a product with an existing and historically important industry here in Britain. The aim is not to have everyone use it, just to allow those who want to.",
        "background": "For smokeless tobacco to be exempted from the generational tobacco ban. We believe smokeless tobacco (snuff) could help push some people away from consuming vape and all illegal drugs and that this could be a step to help create a socially, mentally healthier and more mature society.",
